#: src/data/profile.ts:37
msgid ""
"Before that, I spent 12 years running my own software factory, delivering "
"web, mobile and touch-kiosk products for regulated clients in gaming, "
"government and health."
msgstr ""
"Antes de eso, durante 12 años dirigí mi propia fábrica de software, "
"desarrollando productos web, móviles y para kioscos táctiles para clientes "
"de sectores regulados: juegos de azar, gobierno y salud."

#: src/data/profile.ts:258
msgid ""
"Built a standalone chat-transcript package with configuration UI, sorting, "
"role-based download permissions and PDF generation, and integrated it into "
"the agent console."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollé un paquete independiente de transcripciones de chat con interfaz "
"de configuración, ordenamiento, permisos de descarga por rol y generación "
"de PDFs, y lo integré en la consola de agentes."

#: src/data/profile.ts:225
msgid "Built an AI-powered provider search and conversational agents."
msgstr "Desarrollé un buscador de prestadores con IA y agentes conversacionales."

#: src/data/profile.ts:224
msgid ""
"Built and maintained the embeddable patient SDK and component library with "
"React, TypeScript and semantic-release, consumed by enterprise health-plan "
