#: src/data/profile.ts:34
msgid ""
"The last five years were at a US digital-health company working with HIPAA "
"and Medicare/Medicaid Parts C & D, where I grew from Senior Front-end "
"Engineer to Lead (2022) to Staff (2026)."
msgstr ""
"Los últimos cinco años trabajé en una empresa estadounidense de salud "
"digital, en el contexto de HIPAA y Medicare/Medicaid Partes C y D, donde "
"pasé de Senior Front-end Engineer a Lead (2022) y a Staff (2026)."

